>> Want to contribute?

RetiBooks is looking for volunteers who want to help out with finding, uploading and importing books to the library.

You could help with:

 - Adding important authors from your language
 - Adding translated versions to existing books
 - Writing short biographies
 - Other Editor-related tasks

